tinacloud-project-update-protected-branch(1) -- Manage protected branches
==========================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project update protected-branch` <command>

## DESCRIPTION

Add or remove protected branches for a TinaCloud project. This feature is
available only to projects with editorial workflow.

## COMMANDS

  * `add`:
    Add one or more protected branches.

  * `remove`:
    Remove one or more protected branches.

## EXAMPLES

Protect the main and development branches:

	$ tinacloud project update protected-branch add \
		--branch main \
		--branch develop

Remove a branch that no longer needs protection:

	$ tinacloud project update protected-branch remove --branch develop

